# Never add OpenWhispr runtime data or credentials, even encrypted credentials.
**/open-whispr/
**/open-whispr-*/
**/chezmoi-openwhispr/
**/openwhispr-sync/node_modules/
**/openwhispr-sync/.env*
**/openwhispr-sync/secure-keys/

# Thaw runtime state can include private menu titles and hardware identifiers.
**/*com.stonerl.Thaw*.plist*
**/Thaw/
**/private_Thaw/

# FluidVoice mixes preferences with credentials, chat state and device IDs.
**/*com.FluidApp.app*.plist*
**/FluidVoice/
**/private_FluidVoice/
**/FluidAudio/
**/private_FluidAudio/
**/FluidIntelligence/
**/private_FluidIntelligence/
**/com.FluidApp.app/
**/private_com.FluidApp.app/
**/FluidVoice LiteLLM Relay/
**/private_FluidVoice LiteLLM Relay/
**/Caches/com.FluidApp.app/
**/Logs/FluidVoice/
**/Saved Application State/com.FluidApp.app.savedState/
